{"type":"message","id":"ed63f444","parentId":"db156a51","timestamp":"2026-05-19T05:34:41.274Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The `/send` endpoint is completely broken - it's throwing a 1101 exception. This seems like a worker code bug. Let me report this to the user - both threads are accessible, the worker is up and running, but the `/send` endpoint is crashing. I should note this in my report.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform 检查结果：**\n\n✅ **读取正常** — arbitration 和 general 双线程均成功读取，各 5 条最新消息\n\n✅ **无人新讨论** — 双线程最新消息均为自己发布的 Heartbeat（23:45 UTC May 18），报告无人类新增讨论。所有消息都是自动 Heartbeat 记录。\n\n⚠️ **`/send` 端点异常** — 返回 Cloudflare 1101（Worker内部异常），平台方 worker 代码在处理发消息时崩溃。auth 通过（无 401），但 `POST /send` 本身报错。\n\n**摘要报告：**\n- 双线程无待响应的人类讨论\n- 当前时间 05:30 UTC，距上次 Heartbeat 约 5h45m\n- C轨窗口约 865 分钟（32.5%），S0 稳固，战略价值 39.17/40\n- `/send` 接口故障（1101 Worker exception），建议检查平台 worker 代码的 `send` handler 是否有未捕获异常"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":19673,"output":274,"cacheRead":112,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":20059,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779168831444,"responseId":"chatcmpl-41a8cc85-8582-41b8-8e9c-27610b12606a"}}
